{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"project":1},{"slug":2,"info_box":3,"info_box_thumb":4,"title":5,"date":6,"location":7,"description":8,"type":9,"tags":10,"developer":7,"publisher":9,"ip":15,"platform":16,"status":17,"role":18,"release_date":6,"links":19,"featured":3,"content":26,"resources":27,"thumbnailMetadata":120},"gabbys-dollhouse",true,"/microfolio/content/projects/gabbys-dollhouse/images/gabbys-side-thumb.png","Gabby's Dollhouse: Create and Play","2021","Mighty Kingdom","The original Gabby's Dollhouse game played by 25 million Gabby's fans worldwide! Explore the dollhouse, scan your toys, and play with them in the game!","Spin Master",[11,12,13,14],"Family","iOS","Android","Amazon Freetime","Gabby's Dollhouse","iOS, Google Play, Amazon Kids+","Live Ops","Game Lead",[20,23],{"title":21,"url":22},"Google Play","https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.spinmaster.gabbysdollhouse",{"title":24,"url":25},"App Store","https://apps.apple.com/us/app/gabbys-dollhouse-create-play/id1488385103","\u003Cdiv style=\"display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center\">\n  \u003Cimg src=\"/microfolio/content/projects/gabbys-dollhouse/images/gabbys-1.png\" alt=\"Gabby's Dollhouse image 1\" style=\"width:50%;border-radius:4px\" />\n  \u003Cimg src=\"/microfolio/content/projects/gabbys-dollhouse/images/gabbys-2.png\" alt=\"Gabby's Dollhouse image 2\" style=\"width:50%;border-radius:4px\" />\n\u003C/div>\n\n\u003Ch2>What&#39;s the IP/Game?\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>Gabby&#39;s Dollhouse is \u003Cstrong>#1 most-watched animated series on Netflix\u003C/strong>, and has a vast range of toys\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Mighty Kingdom developed the accompanying mobile game, which has achieved \u003Cstrong>over 20m installs\u003C/strong> over its lifetime. \u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>The premise of the app follows the same as the show: to explore the dollhouse, create new things, and play with friends! \u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>While it can be played independantly, the game does integrate with the physical toys, where players can scan a QR code that comes with their toy to then add it into their game to play with.\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\u003Ch2>So what did I actually do?\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cp>I took over as \u003Cstrong>Game Lead\u003C/strong> in 2024, several years into the product&#39;s life, \u003Cstrong>managing the team and direction\u003C/strong> as part of ongoing game updates. \u003C/p>\n\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cp>This included a major update alongside the release of the Gabby&#39;s Dollhouse Movie in 2025, which introduced new content, minigames, toy integrations, and long-standing bug fixes to improve the overall playability of the game. \u003C/p>\n\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Overall, my responsabilities were:\u003C/p>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>Directing design on updates to give the best player experience\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Ongoing comms with the IP holder\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Team planning and resourcing\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Release management\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>General in-engine work\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Occasional QA\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n",{"images":28,"videos":118,"documents":119},[29,59,74,89,104],{"name":30,"path":31,"hasWebP":3,"metadata":32},"gabbys-1.png","/microfolio/content/projects/gabbys-dollhouse/images/gabbys-1.png",{"credit":33,"source":33,"description":33,"headline":33,"keywords":33,"camera":33,"lens":33,"focalLength":33,"aperture":33,"shutterSpeed":33,"iso":33,"dateTime":33,"gps":33,"city":33,"state":33,"country":33,"location":33,"raw":34,"creditLine":33},null,{"png":35,"pngFile":35,"file":55},{"Image Width":36,"Image Height":39,"Bit Depth":42,"Color Type":45,"Compression":48,"Filter":51,"Interlace":53},{"value":37,"description":38},1920,"1920px",{"value":40,"description":41},1080,"1080px",{"value":43,"description":44},8,"8",{"value":46,"description":47},6,"RGB with Alpha",{"value":49,"description":50},0,"Deflate/Inflate",{"value":49,"description":52},"Adaptive",{"value":